            "review_title": "Review at Wrap&Roll Saigon Centre, Q.1",
            "review_text": "cclye\nGeorge Town, Malaysia1025 contributions\n1\nVarious kinds of Viet rolls\nMay 2019 • Family\nThis restaurant is perhaps a novelty for tourists who are first time to Vietnam.\n\nIf you order one of the large platters, you will get 5-6 types of grilled meat and rolls.\n\nI like the summer rolls (wrapped in semi translucent rice paper) and deep fried spring rolls. The build-your-own rolls - my family and I are not so good in rolling our own.\nRead more\nWritten May 9, 2019",
